  "summary": "Register the exact CC-018 semantic-requirements boundary.",
  "why": "All four direct dependencies are complete and exactly bound. CC-018 may now own only the neutral shared-requirements registry, its worker report, and its fixed validation test. Canonical symmetric owner separation keeps the requirements owner distinct from every planned source, direct-input, oracle, and trace owner without starting content or compiler work."
